taskForgeWebServer is webServer
taskForgeWebServer purpose "Host the TaskForge Web JSON REST API on localhost:18090; every API route except /, /health, /api/version, and /api/auth/{register,login} requires a valid session cookie."
taskForgeWebServer host "127.0.0.1"
taskForgeWebServer port 18090
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/" homePageHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/dashboard" dashboardPageHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/assets/:filename" staticAssetHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/health" healthHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/api/version" versionHandler
taskForgeWebServer route POST "/api/auth/register" registerHandler
taskForgeWebServer route POST "/api/auth/login" loginHandler
taskForgeWebServer route POST "/api/auth/logout" logoutHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/api/auth/me" meHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/api/todos" listTodosHandler
taskForgeWebServer route POST "/api/todos" createTodoHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "/api/todos/:id" showTodoHandler
taskForgeWebServer route DELETE "/api/todos/:id" deleteTodoHandler
taskForgeWebServer route POST "/api/todos/:id/complete" completeTodoHandler
taskForgeWebServer route POST "/api/todos/:id/uncomplete" uncompleteTodoHandler
taskForgeWebServer route GET "*" notFoundPageHandler

bcryptHashCompute is capability
bcryptHashCompute grants compute bcryptHash
bcryptHashCompute purpose "Authority to run the bcrypt password hashing key schedule at cost 12."


bcryptRandomCompute is capability
bcryptRandomCompute grants compute bcryptRandom
bcryptRandomCompute purpose "Authority to draw bytes from the platform CSPRNG via bcrypt.randomBytes - used to mint session tokens."


heapAllocCapability is capability
heapAllocCapability grants allocate heap
heapAllocCapability purpose "Authority to allocate per-request scratch buffers (JSON builder, base64url output, etc.)."


heapFreeCapability is capability
heapFreeCapability grants free heap
heapFreeCapability purpose "Authority to free the same buffers via defer c.free at handler exit."


jsonDocumentReadCapability is capability
jsonDocumentReadCapability grants read json.document.tree
jsonDocumentReadCapability purpose "Authority to parse and read request JSON through the standard.json document cursor API."


jsonDocumentWriteCapability is capability
jsonDocumentWriteCapability grants write json.document.tree
jsonDocumentWriteCapability purpose "Authority to build response JSON through the standard.json document mutator API."


filesystemCreateCapability is capability
filesystemCreateCapability grants create filesystem
filesystemCreateCapability purpose "Authority to create the build/images/ directory at startup."


filesystemReadCapability is capability
filesystemReadCapability grants read filesystem
filesystemReadCapability purpose "Authority to read files from the app assets directory for static response serving."


filesystemReadWriteCapability is capability
filesystemReadWriteCapability grants readWrite filesystem
filesystemReadWriteCapability purpose "Authority to append structured log records through standard.log."


memoryBufferReadWriteCapability is capability
memoryBufferReadWriteCapability grants readWrite memory.buffer
memoryBufferReadWriteCapability purpose "Authority to read and write the in-op scratch buffers - register/login zero the password scratch via c.memset before c.free; the JSON document and snprintf paths also touch buffer memory."


httpRequestReader is capability
httpRequestReader grants read http.request
httpRequestReader purpose "Authority to read request path, headers, cookies, and body text from the incoming HttpRequest."


httpResponseWriter is capability
httpResponseWriter grants write http.response
httpResponseWriter purpose "Authority to write status, headers, files, and response bodies to the HttpResponse."


sqliteDatabaseReader is capability
sqliteDatabaseReader grants read database
sqliteDatabaseReader purpose "Authority to execute read-only SQLite statements against the shared database handle."


sqliteDatabaseReadWriter is capability
sqliteDatabaseReadWriter grants readWrite database
sqliteDatabaseReadWriter purpose "Authority to execute schema, read, and write SQLite statements against the shared database handle."



