openOrReuseDatabase is operation
openOrReuseDatabase out Result SqliteDatabase Int32
openOrReuseDatabase effect readWrite database
openOrReuseDatabase effect create filesystem
openOrReuseDatabase effect read filesystem
openOrReuseDatabase effect write filesystem
openOrReuseDatabase effect readWrite filesystem
openOrReuseDatabase effect open filesystem
openOrReuseDatabase effect open file
openOrReuseDatabase effect close file
openOrReuseDatabase effect readWrite memory.buffer
openOrReuseDatabase effect allocate heap
openOrReuseDatabase effect free heap
openOrReuseDatabase uses filesystemCreateAuthority
openOrReuseDatabase uses filesystemReadAuthority
openOrReuseDatabase uses filesystemWriteAuthority
openOrReuseDatabase uses filesystemOpenAuthority
openOrReuseDatabase uses fileOpenAuthority
openOrReuseDatabase uses fileCloseAuthority
openOrReuseDatabase uses sqliteDatabaseReadWriter
openOrReuseDatabase uses filesystemCreateCapability
openOrReuseDatabase uses filesystemReadWriteCapability
openOrReuseDatabase uses memoryBufferReadWriteCapability
openOrReuseDatabase uses heapAllocCapability
openOrReuseDatabase uses heapFreeCapability
openOrReuseDatabase memory heap auto
openOrReuseDatabase async no
openOrReuseDatabase purpose "Return the shared SqliteDatabase handle, lazily opening + applying the schema on first call. Idempotent: subsequent calls return the cached handle."
openOrReuseDatabase invariant "sharedDatabaseReady=1 implies sharedDatabaseHandle is a valid open SqliteDatabase. The first caller wins the open; concurrent opens are impossible under the blocking HTTP/1.1 backend."
openOrReuseDatabase let applyDevSeedEqualSentinel immutable Int32 0
openOrReuseDatabase let readyMarker immutable Int32 1
openOrReuseDatabase do readinessCheckCall
openOrReuseDatabase branch if sharedDatabaseNotReady goto performInitialOpen
openOrReuseDatabase return sharedDatabaseHandle nil
openOrReuseDatabase at performInitialOpen do ensureImagesDirCall
openOrReuseDatabase do ensureLogsDirCall
openOrReuseDatabase do openLogFileCall
openOrReuseDatabase do serverStartLogCall
openOrReuseDatabase do openCall
openOrReuseDatabase branch ifError openCall goto databaseOpenFailed
openOrReuseDatabase do applySchemaCall
openOrReuseDatabase branch ifError applySchemaCall goto schemaApplyFailed
openOrReuseDatabase do applyDevSeedCompareCall
openOrReuseDatabase do applyDevSeedShouldRunCheckCall
openOrReuseDatabase branch if applyDevSeedShouldRun goto applyDevSeedRunStep
openOrReuseDatabase goto devSeedSkippedLabel
openOrReuseDatabase at applyDevSeedRunStep do applyDevSeedCall
openOrReuseDatabase branch ifError applyDevSeedCall goto schemaApplyFailed
openOrReuseDatabase at devSeedSkippedLabel set sharedDatabaseHandle freshDatabase
openOrReuseDatabase set sharedDatabaseReady readyMarker
openOrReuseDatabase return freshDatabase nil
openOrReuseDatabase at databaseOpenFailed return nil databaseOpenError
openOrReuseDatabase at schemaApplyFailed do closeFreshDatabaseAfterSchemaFailureCall
openOrReuseDatabase branch ifError closeFreshDatabaseAfterSchemaFailureCall goto schemaInitialErrorReported
openOrReuseDatabase at schemaInitialErrorReported return nil schemaApplyError

