requireSessionUserId is operation
requireSessionUserId in request HttpRequest
requireSessionUserId out Int64
requireSessionUserId effect read http.request.header
requireSessionUserId effect read database
requireSessionUserId uses httpRequestReader
requireSessionUserId uses sqliteDatabaseReader
requireSessionUserId uses fileCloseAuthority
requireSessionUserId uses fileOpenAuthority
requireSessionUserId uses filesystemCreateAuthority
requireSessionUserId uses filesystemOpenAuthority
requireSessionUserId uses filesystemReadAuthority
requireSessionUserId uses filesystemReadWriteCapability
requireSessionUserId uses filesystemWriteAuthority
requireSessionUserId uses heapAllocCapability
requireSessionUserId uses heapFreeCapability
requireSessionUserId uses memoryBufferReadWriteCapability
requireSessionUserId uses sqliteDatabaseReadWriter
requireSessionUserId memory arena request
requireSessionUserId async no
requireSessionUserId purpose "Resolve the request's session cookie to its owning user id. Returns -1 when the cookie is missing OR the session row is absent OR the session has expired - callers treat any negative value as 'no auth' and respond 401."
requireSessionUserId invariant "Never throws; returns -1 on every failure path so callers do not need branch-on-error plumbing. Side-effects: reads cookie + does one SELECT against sessions."
requireSessionUserId let noSessionUserId immutable Int64 -1
requireSessionUserId do cookieReadCall
requireSessionUserId do tokenNullCheckCall
requireSessionUserId branch if sessionTokenMissing goto requireSessionAttachedNoCookie
requireSessionUserId do sessionTokenLengthCall
requireSessionUserId do sessionTokenLengthOkCheckCall
requireSessionUserId branch if sessionTokenLengthOk goto sessionTokenLengthAcceptedLabel
requireSessionUserId goto requireSessionAttachedNoCookie
requireSessionUserId at sessionTokenLengthAcceptedLabel do openDatabaseForSessionCall
requireSessionUserId branch ifError openDatabaseForSessionCall goto requireSessionDatabaseUnavailableFailed
requireSessionUserId do prepareSessionLookupCall
requireSessionUserId branch ifError prepareSessionLookupCall goto requireSessionPrepareFailed
requireSessionUserId defer finalizeSessionLookupDefer
requireSessionUserId do bindSessionTokenCall
requireSessionUserId branch ifError bindSessionTokenCall goto requireSessionBindFailed
requireSessionUserId do stepSessionLookupCall
requireSessionUserId branch ifError stepSessionLookupCall goto requireSessionStepFailed
requireSessionUserId do sessionFoundCheckCall
requireSessionUserId branch if sessionFound goto sessionFoundLabel
requireSessionUserId return noSessionUserId
requireSessionUserId at sessionFoundLabel do readSessionUserIdCall
requireSessionUserId do readSessionExpiresCall
requireSessionUserId do nowMsForExpiryCall
requireSessionUserId do sessionExpiredCheckCall
requireSessionUserId branch if sessionExpired goto sessionExpiredLabel
requireSessionUserId return sessionUserId
requireSessionUserId at sessionExpiredLabel return noSessionUserId
requireSessionUserId at requireSessionAttachedNoCookie return noSessionUserId
requireSessionUserId at requireSessionDatabaseUnavailableFailed return noSessionUserId
requireSessionUserId at requireSessionPrepareFailed return noSessionUserId
requireSessionUserId at requireSessionBindFailed return noSessionUserId
requireSessionUserId at requireSessionStepFailed return noSessionUserId

