assetFilenameNullCheckCall in staticAssetHandler
assetFilenameNullCheckCall invokes pointer.isNull
assetFilenameNullCheckCall arg pointer OpaquePointer assetFilename
assetFilenameNullCheckCall out assetFilenameMissing Bool

